    "innovation": "This paper assesses a statistically selected five-model climate subset for Japan, demonstrating it effectively captures the full range of CMIP6 projections, proving superior to global warming level constraints for capturing uncertainties in variables like precipitation, solar radiation, and wind speed that are sensitive to regional factors.",
    "kg_extraction_triplets": [
